{"version":1,"content":"<p>內地女星王楚然、周也、李昀銳、曾舜晞及竇驍等前日於北京三里屯亮相品牌周年慶暨聖誕點燈儀式，王楚然與周也各具美態，王楚然穿上粉色Deep V西裝配長裙，而周也因天氣寒冷於戶外祝酒時穿上紅色外套，但當回到室內即脫去外套，大騷靚靚黑色吊帶晚裝裙，</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T16:24:27.137227+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T16:01:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T16:17:35.764721+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T16:17:35.764721+00:00","content_hash":"914dbaf862476bbf6930010d8ed5ca45b42363b26c85150341a89a733a9ffdeb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}